Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Note:  EPL Smart Budget Tracker
Note:  A personal finance analyzer written in pure English
Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Note: === Set Up Our Budget Categories ===

Create a list called categories equal to ["Rent", "Groceries", "Transport", "Entertainment", "Utilities", "Savings"]

Create a list called amounts equal to [1200, 450, 150, 200, 180, 500]

Create total_budget equal to 3000

Note: === Calculate Total Spending ===

Create total_spent equal to 0
For each amount in amounts
    Increase total_spent by amount
End

Create remaining equal to total_budget - total_spent

Say "═══════════════════════════════════════════"
Say "         💰 Monthly Budget Report          "
Say "═══════════════════════════════════════════"
Say ""
Say "Budget: $" + total_budget
Say "Spent:  $" + total_spent
Say "Left:   $" + remaining
Say ""

Note: === Show Each Category ===

Say "──── Breakdown by Category ────"
Say ""

For i from 0 to 5
    Create category equal to categories[i]
    Create amount equal to amounts[i]
    Create percentage equal to round((amount / total_budget) * 100)
    
    Note: Build a visual bar
    Create bar_length equal to round(percentage / 2)
    Create bar equal to ""
    For j from 1 to bar_length
        Set bar to bar + "█"
    End
    
    Say category + ": $" + amount + " (" + percentage + "%) " + bar
End

Say ""

Note: === Smart Insights ===

Say "──── Smart Insights ────"
Say ""

Note: Find the biggest expense
Create max_amount equal to 0
Create max_category equal to ""
For i from 0 to 5
    If amounts[i] > max_amount then
        Set max_amount to amounts[i]
        Set max_category to categories[i]
    End
End
Say "💸 Biggest expense: " + max_category + " at $" + max_amount

Note: Find the smallest expense
Create min_amount equal to 99999
Create min_category equal to ""
For i from 0 to 5
    If amounts[i] < min_amount then
        Set min_amount to amounts[i]
        Set min_category to categories[i]
    End
End
Say "🪙 Smallest expense: " + min_category + " at $" + min_amount

Note: Savings rate
Create savings_rate equal to round((500 / total_budget) * 100)
Say "📊 Savings rate: " + savings_rate + "%"

Note: Budget health check
If remaining > 0 then
    Say "✅ You're under budget by $" + remaining + "!"
Else
    Create overspent equal to 0 - remaining
    Say "🚨 You're OVER budget by $" + overspent + "!"
End

Note: === Spending Advice ===
Say ""
Say "──── Recommendations ────"
Say ""

If savings_rate < 20 then
    Say "⚠️  Your savings rate is below 20%. Try to save more!"
Else
    Say "👍 Great savings rate! You're on track."
End

Create rent_ratio equal to round((1200 / total_budget) * 100)
If rent_ratio > 30 then
    Say "⚠️  Rent is " + rent_ratio + "% of budget (above the 30% rule)"
Else
    Say "👍 Rent is " + rent_ratio + "% of budget (within the 30% rule)"
End

Create entertainment_ratio equal to round((200 / total_budget) * 100)
Say "🎬 Entertainment is " + entertainment_ratio + "% of your budget"

Say ""
Say "═══════════════════════════════════════════"
Say "  Report generated by EPL Budget Tracker   "
Say "═══════════════════════════════════════════"
